    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='How to use the report'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/MonthlyPerformance-CityClusters_16618660932220/Howtousethereport?rev=' id='Howtousethereport' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/MonthlyPerformance-CityClusters_16618660932220' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1500' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1500' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='17195' id='22' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='20338'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>

The 3 Clusters are defined based on the above parameters + if </run>
              <run bold='true'>the city is competitive</run>
              <run> in terms of :

Market Share ( &gt;=10%) ; Brand Interest (&gt;=5%) ; Brand NPS, if the customer uses only DH services and none from competition (&gt;=50%). 
The order of priority is as in the above order, eg. if the Market Share passes 10% we do not need to look at the other metrics, city is marked as competitive, if not we look at the next metric. If we pass no criteria from the 3 competitive metrics the city is marked as not competitive.
</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
